 "_note": "THE NATIVE WAVE — 8 lanes on the web-native gap, 30 SECTIONS (css-view-transitions joins via the SIXTH BAKE). iOS +45: css-tables 25->36 (the N2 UA display channel + shrink-to-fit + separated-tracks completion: 11 f->P device-verified TWICE independently, zero P->f), css-sizing +8 (aspect-ratio at depth), css-ui +1 (the §10.8 widget line-box chain: appearance-revert 0.82->0.99), css-values +2, text-decor +1. THE VT BAKE (view-transition-bake.mjs, 1260 lines, 67 tests): drives the transition to its frozen state in the ref browser and serializes the settled ::view-transition pseudo tree as ordinary boxes; measured +21/-1 web (50->70/192) and PINNED into section-runner per the engagement-must-not-depend-on-ambient-state principle — css-view-transitions joins the gate at 23/21/21 of 46. ANDROID: the wave went RED first — the unverified Compose table fold lost 13 cells (the fold premise was FALSE: the extractor never emits an implied tbody; RenderTableContent is a REWRITE only total for canonical table->tr->td trees) — the fix landed consumableRowList (the structural precondition), stopped folding orphan rows, and removed the fabricated 1dp demo cell border (no CSS basis); all 13 restored + 1 masked css-backgrounds loss found and fixed + the collapsed-border gain kept: Android net +27. N1 axis gate (widget line-box constants are horizontal-tb solves — vertical writing modes suppress), N3 §2.1 || grammar gate (invalid decoration lists drop loudly, both emitters), N6 direction-rtl ICB propagation (web), N7 aspect-ratio depth mechanisms, N8 Compose pre-break pipeline (rule B via zero-width break opportunities, WPT-gated). QUICK WINS: /images/ sparse-checkout fixed (+image-set assets; 69 stale refs invalidated and recaptured with assets present — the css-page P->f artifact repaired at the source), ObjectPosition->PositionParser migration, conditional @import (canvas-media + supports eval), native lang locale twins. OPERATIONAL: six lanes died on API disconnects mi